00:35:26.890 --> 00:35:30.020
I just wanted to make sure that those-
Kevin Rose: No, you know what's funny is,

00:35:30.020 --> 00:35:34.829
all jokes aside, Tim, seriously, in the last
four weeks I've really focused on my legs,

00:35:34.829 --> 00:35:37.110
