02:36:34.010 --> 02:36:42.400
So, after that experience, I decided to take
a hiatus from partaking.

02:36:42.400 --> 02:36:47.440
And there are significant, not just psychological,
but in some cases physiological risks associated

02:36:47.440 --> 02:36:48.490
