02:42:21.080 --> 02:42:22.330
I think I am very good at it.

02:42:22.330 --> 02:42:23.590
Kevin Rose: I agree.

02:42:23.590 --> 02:42:29.649
Tim Ferriss: And I think the vast majority
of people who consume these things are children

02:42:29.649 --> 02:42:32.710
playing with loaded handguns.

02:42:32.710 --> 02:42:41.100
They don't realize the risks they're taking,
and the horrifying episodes generally don't

02:42:41.100 --> 02:42:43.820
get a lot of airtime.

02:42:43.820 --> 02:42:49.900
So there's a survivorship bias, where people
end up hearing the positive, life altering

02:42:49.900 --> 02:42:50.990
experiences.

02:42:50.990 --> 02:42:56.650
And then the incorrect conclusion is made,
that the vast majority of experiences are

02:42:56.650 --> 02:42:57.650
like that.

02:42:57.650 --> 02:43:01.070
And I have not seen any evidence to suggest
that's true.

02:43:01.070 --> 02:43:07.610
There are many positive, life altering experiences,
but ayahuasca specifically is a big gun.

02:43:07.610 --> 02:43:09.160
It is very powerful.

02:43:09.160 --> 02:43:17.390
And the other warning I would give, in addition
