02:44:58.680 --> 02:45:00.649
Kevin Rose: ... while we're doing this, you're
not going to be doing something crazy?

02:45:00.649 --> 02:45:02.740
I'm like, "I'm freaking out.

02:45:02.740 --> 02:45:04.410
Fuck, I'm freaking out.

02:45:04.410 --> 02:45:06.260
He's masturbating in the corner."

02:45:06.260 --> 02:45:08.090
Tim Ferriss: Generally not.

02:45:08.090 --> 02:45:09.090
No.

02:45:09.090 --> 02:45:11.220
Generally, I'm not like-
Kevin Rose: I'm going to look to you to be

02:45:11.220 --> 02:45:12.220
solid ground.

02:45:12.220 --> 02:45:13.750
Tim Ferriss: Well, I'm not like the exorcist,
